      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"DrScott\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/97f17d/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> DrScott:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Writhe - \"Caliginous Form\" - reduce damage to Writhe by 2, if any remains, redirect it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually the card says to redirect, <strong>then</strong> reduce by 2. So if 2 damage comes to him and he redirects it to something that has +1 damage taken then it will still do damage.</p>",
